                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a536c092-acf0-4a14-aec5-44c069119d3a",
                        "source_entry_id": "4dc2407e-1f7e-3e1b-8436-057ca9d26bcb",
                        "source_sense_id": "72fb7a64-bda5-3d4b-a391-9c6a72c3bd16",
                        "target_lang_word": "sweetness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sweetness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07ae1cdc-7eb4-3847-9101-25567ee51503",
                                        "entry_id": "7fca62f8-1813-305e-9031-7c93b9604f0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being sweet (all senses)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a33b1db-3bae-4f07-a3a9-a5b76b5ef2cb",
                                                "sense_id": "07ae1cdc-7eb4-3847-9101-25567ee51503",
                                                "text": "At the same time, that pain is soothed by the brain’s perception of sweetness on a totally different area of your taste buds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e13a7d5d-055f-3859-83ae-14ca5b5450fa",
                                        "entry_id": "7fca62f8-1813-305e-9031-7c93b9604f0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pleasant disposition; kindness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44687d25-04ea-46f8-881f-5392b4a506f9",
                                                "sense_id": "e13a7d5d-055f-3859-83ae-14ca5b5450fa",
                                                "text": "Ruth's overwhelming sweetness made Robert forget about his hopelessly low school grades."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5294ec1f-68fe-3419-8dd6-db0deef5a2f6",
                                        "entry_id": "7fca62f8-1813-305e-9031-7c93b9604f0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of giving pleasure to the mind or senses, pleasantness, agreeableness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de912810-d17f-4b66-b619-e469207b8288",
                                                "sense_id": "5294ec1f-68fe-3419-8dd6-db0deef5a2f6",
                                                "text": "The thirſt of raigne and ſweetnes of a crowne, […] / Moou’d me to menage armes againſt thy ſtate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa6ea26f-8a55-489a-8d27-ceb72f92ef35",
                                                "sense_id": "5294ec1f-68fe-3419-8dd6-db0deef5a2f6",
                                                "text": "Quiet people too, for I think that about this time a sort of remorseful tenderness comes over the bullies and the nagsters, so that they go about gently and deprecatingly, hoping by one day's record sweetness to outface the year's blusterings."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68094988-4d92-3a2e-8e54-3bfb40020850",
                                        "entry_id": "7fca62f8-1813-305e-9031-7c93b9604f0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A term of address for one's sweetheart."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b708bfbd-9dd6-482f-b9d3-b74d67b0c30a",
                                                "sense_id": "68094988-4d92-3a2e-8e54-3bfb40020850",
                                                "text": "Sweetness, sweetness, I was only joking when I said / I'd like to smash every tooth in your head."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e5608d0-d774-4e66-a0cb-fe6c10ba2ae5",
                                                "sense_id": "68094988-4d92-3a2e-8e54-3bfb40020850",
                                                "text": "\"Hey sweetness,\" he said. \"How was practice?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b915a0de-5ec3-4e1d-8baa-f0f5d5043eff",
                        "source_entry_id": "4dc2407e-1f7e-3e1b-8436-057ca9d26bcb",
                        "source_sense_id": "72fb7a64-bda5-3d4b-a391-9c6a72c3bd16",
                        "target_lang_word": "sucrosité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sucrosité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "140aed5b-b612-3955-a6d4-6a24780c4365",
                                        "entry_id": "bba1b20f-2dad-3c8d-83a7-de03cbf26687",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Caractère de ce qui est sucré."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Didactique"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16aee0a5-5030-4f12-aef7-4c553b5121be",
                                                "sense_id": "140aed5b-b612-3955-a6d4-6a24780c4365",
                                                "text": "Les mûres, confites à point, s’alliaient merveilleusement avec la chair tendre et délicatement parfumée du garenne, mais aussi avec la douceur des pommes et la sucrosité acide des figues."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b3dc9d7-1737-4ffa-b03d-d618acf50a7c",
                                                "sense_id": "140aed5b-b612-3955-a6d4-6a24780c4365",
                                                "text": "L’ensemble est délicat, évolue sur les fruits jaunes au fil de la gorgée ; l’acidité fait place à un filet de sucrosité, ultra-fin et fugace, car l’amertume reprend le dessus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "035cd55a-3687-4add-ae72-6d2f1a78a5cd",
                                                "sense_id": "140aed5b-b612-3955-a6d4-6a24780c4365",
                                                "text": "Et on fait gaffe à la sucrosité de certains fruits, tels la mangue et la banane ainsi que les fruits secs qui ont vite fait de vous transformer en Bibendum."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa7cc4c4-434b-4741-be67-2b4d85aaee1a",
                        "source_entry_id": "4dc2407e-1f7e-3e1b-8436-057ca9d26bcb",
